nce, he commands the Knights of the Yellow Country. He helps the protagonist when she is attacked by a gang of thugs. He is kind and polite, but also a little insensitive to other people's feelings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Yes. I am Beryl of the Royal Knights. Pleased to make your acquaintance.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Adapted from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c114839"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/6321d117e7e5def7283698a96ed0d6f6a1623c2489856e8abc9c6881177f42de.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2c9f36266a87daafa61ccad0148d6bc7ab0d8c38341ec12c631e0c87ccae1006.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"三橋 渡","creatorId":"vndb:s15809","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15809","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15809","name":"三橋 渡","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:92310","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c114841","characterName":"ラヴア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c114841"},"originalCharacterName":"ラヴア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"19"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"178"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A fudashi from the Red Country. A young man the protagonist meets in the Yellow Country. He is violent, but has a big brotherly and daring personality. Raised in a slum as a child, he can be a bit of a handful when dealing with ruffians..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"It's nothing. I just wondered if there are people like you in the Yellow Country.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Adapted from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c114841"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/69/695917941de0682bc37e70a19a33e220af5750cde75a76437d5128051b7937ee.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/60e7ab853755950332d2b66171dfa26edbf3a6706ba47f7166472e50f82842f2.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"片桐 良一","creatorId":"vndb:s11853","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11853","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11853","name":"片桐 良一","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:92309","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c114843","characterName":"クロム","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c114843"},"originalCharacterName":"クロム","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"17"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"171"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young man who rescued the protagonist from an attack by a beast when she visited the Green Country. He is taciturn and uncommunicative. He does not want to get along with others. He has a good sense of sight and smell."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"You can just call me Chrom. I don't like being addressed by honorific titles.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Adapted from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c114843"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9ac4e35dae699a777f23d7480f787fdba50145cd8141f641f3403b760ba78029.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7ae8dd4143c153e8dc9062f7bf7cbd2ee40918af095c4ebdb61b666f924afa47.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"乃木 悠星","creatorId":"vndb:s26835","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s26835","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s26835","name":"乃木 悠星","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:92313","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c114845","characterName":"ラピスラズリ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c114845"},"originalCharacterName":"ラピスラズリ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"28"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"180"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The king of the Blue Kingdom, which rules the Northern region. He thinks of himself less as a man and more as a tool for the maintenance of his kingdom. A proud realist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"My aim is to wipe out conflict from this world. That is all.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Adapted from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c114845"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/ed7a2c408751b62006bd9fe15a5068145d6564eca5cbca2b881174edc217ee69.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/136c7633162f4107896053d7c5b43fbbe4739b2b98994076e3ec159fe92acca3.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c114847","characterName":"ジェット","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c114847"},"originalCharacterName":"ジェット","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"revi