y towards everyone. He sometimes appears before the protagonists and gives her advice. Something about him makes him seem otherworldly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Yes, this is the Church of the Yellow Country. And I am the priest of this church, Serenite. Pleased to make your acquaintance.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Adapted from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c114848"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/151fb22e897207d445ab5cc9c6a529a2b1b17100c134862ecdc81ef61edb2f90.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/142dcde7c7776a8dc59f59218f8105033a0926268bca68ab7e0ddb352330f687.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鈴蘭 遊嬉","creatorId":"vndb:s25262","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s25262","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s25262","name":"鈴蘭 遊嬉","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:92312","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c114849","characterName":"ヘリオ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c114849"},"originalCharacterName":"ヘリオ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"14"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The second prince of the Yellow Kingdom and Beryl's younger brother. Childlike, innocent and friendly. However, his words are sometimes tainted with malice and he may show a calculating nature that doesn't match his age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Big brother! So you were here already?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Adapted from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c11484